{"c":"431038","n":"OHŘE 17","t":"M","s":"ZČ","o":"Kynšperk nad Ohří","url":"431038-ohre-17","stav":"2026-10-06","popis":"GPS Z: 50°7'25.609\"N, 12°31'39.844\"E, K: 50°6'40.767\"N, 12°28'12.896\"E\nPřítok Labe. Od jezu v Kynšperku nad Ohří (ř. km 218,6) až k silničnímu mostu v obci Nebanice (ř. km 225,9) mimo Libocký a Kynžvartský potok a říčku Odravu na ř. km 214,0.\nNa celém revíru je povolen lov z plavidel.\nPřítoky do revíru nepatří, tvoří samostatný pstruhový revír.","delka":7,"rozloha":25,"lat":50.115522,"lon":12.498992,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/kynsperk-nad-ohri","mo_tel":"608 602 808","mo_mail":"","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Losos obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Mník jednovousý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":